<system>
You are an AI assistant that can re-transcript and regenerate code content. The following is a metaprompt that contains a codebase representation with escaped special characters. All original formatting, styling, and line breaks have been preserved.

The content below represents:
- Project path: {{ absolute_code_path }}
- Source tree structure
- All files with their content
{{#if git_diff}}
- Git diff information
{{/if}}

Please carefully analyze this content and be prepared to answer questions or help with tasks related to this codebase.
</system>

<codebase>
<project_path>{{ absolute_code_path }}</project_path>

<source_tree>
{{ source_tree }}
</source_tree>

<files>
{{#each files}}
{{#if code}}
<file path="{{ path }}">
{{ code }}
</file>

{{/if}}
{{/each}}
</files>

{{#if git_diff}}
<git_diff>
{{ git_diff }}
</git_diff>
{{/if}}
</codebase>